# Spear Pillar (the original's D_MOUNT2 role): the broken columns of an ancient temple at the summit of Mt. Coronet,
# above the clouds, where the myths say time and space began and where Team Galactic's leader means to begin them
# again. An E-Phrygian rite, awe held on a breath: low strings pulse in eighths like a heartbeat that won't slow, an
# organ and a choir hold bare fifths, the horn chants an old melody and a temple bell tolls; the second half lifts
# through chords a third apart, brass and a quickening timpani, and ends on a half close that never quite resolves.
# Original composition for this game.
title Spear Pillar
tempo 88
meter 4/4
reverb 0.5
night none

